Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): error boundary and toast notifications

- ErrorBoundary catches unhandled render/effect errors and shows a friendly
  recovery screen with the error message + a reset button instead of a blank
  page.
- ToastProvider exposes useToast() with success / error / info helpers,
  auto-dismiss after 4.5s, stacked bottom-right.
- Wired into App.tsx (match calculation errors) and MatchSelector.tsx
  (refresh-one and refresh-all outcomes).
